  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marine Turtle Conservation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will continue and strengthen the long -term monitoring programme for the olive ridely arribada population at Rushikulya, olive ridleys generally in Orissa and leatherbacks in Andaman Islands; initate a conservation program for green turtles in the Lakshadweep Islands; and continue to facilitate and strengthen the work of a broad network of partners to conserve marine turtles throughout the Indian mainland and islands.</narrative>
  </description>
